AI Features in Vally Support Site
Overview
The Vally support site implements a sophisticated Business Discovery Agent Network - a multi-agent AI system designed to find, research, and qualify fishing guide and charter businesses. The system uses Mastra vNext Agent Networks with cloud-hosted infrastructure to provide comprehensive business intelligence for lead generation and partnership opportunities.
Architecture
Core Technology Stack
Mastra Agent Framework: Uses @mastra/client-js to connect to cloud-hosted Mastra agent networks
Streaming AI Interface: Real-time streaming responses using AI SDK's createUIMessageStream
TypeScript + Zod: Fully typed schemas for all AI data structures and responses
Next.js API Routes: RESTful endpoints for chat management and message persistence
Memory Persistence: Thread-based conversation memory with cross-session continuity
Agent Network: "sonar-discovery-network"
The system implements a 4-agent coordinated network:
🔍 Business Search Agent: Multi-platform discovery across government registries, industry directories (FishingBooker, Viator), social media, and review platforms
📞 Contact Research Agent: Deep website analysis, contact extraction, and verification
✅ Quality Assurance Agent: Business legitimacy validation with 0-100 scoring system
🗺️ Geographic Specialist: Location-specific research and market coverage analysis
